  "text": "At the serving layer, PagedAttention manages KV cache memory like virtual memory pages, eliminating VRAM fragmentation so more users fit per GPU. Modern clusters also use prefill-decode disaggregation, separating compute-heavy prefill GPUs from memory-heavy decode GPUs so long prompts never stall active users streaming responses.",
